             URL - SubSite - /sites/AAAAA0626</narrative><display x="-240" y="-165" w="270" h="60" /></stage><stage stageid="5eecc057-e040-412b-82db-d987ca74def3" name="Get Tenant ID" type="Action"><subsheetid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</subsheetid><narrative>Returns the value of the specified credentials property.

