You will not be able to call this action from a business process, nor will it be called at any other time than before the disposal of the business object.</narrative><display x="-180" y="60" w="180" h="230" /></stage><stage stageid="d540a224-b50e-4b38-84f4-0648491364e5" name="Note2" type="Note"><narrative>Initialise Page

