You will not be able to call this action from a business process, nor will it be called at any other time than after the creation of the object.</narrative><display x="-180" y="60" w="180" h="230" /></stage><stage stageid="4825f137-b223-493d-9384-c1b34010f2b2" name="Capture Screenshot" type="SubSheetInfo"><subsheetid>786bc679-3987-448e-b3d5-821818e0556f</subsheetid><narrative>Screenshot will be captured and the output will be the complete path to the file.
